{"repositoryId":1213004527,"availability":"available","full":"SchemaTex/SchemaTex","name":"SchemaTex","description":"Every diagram a doctor, engineer, or lawyer would actually use. Free. Fully open source. Made for AI. 20 industry-standard diagrams from a text DSL. Pure SVG, zero deps.","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"TypeScript","stars":85,"forks":4,"created":"2026-04-17T00:28:07Z","updated":"2026-10-07T03:01:17Z","license":"AGPL-3.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://schematex.js.org","topics":["diagrams","dsl","genogram","ladder-logic-diagram","mermaid-alternative","pedigree","svg"],"demo":"https://schematex.js.org/playground","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T17:01:35.535Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-15T17:01:35.535Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-15T17:01:35.535Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-15T17:01:35.535Z","stars":85,"forks":4}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Every diagram a doctor, engineer, or lawyer would actually use.","McGoldrick genograms · NSGC pedigrees · IEC 61131-3 ladder logic · IEEE 315 single-line diagrams · Newick phylogenetic trees · Howard-Raiffa decision trees · Moreno sociograms · and more — all from a tiny text DSL, with zero runtime dependencies.","Schematex is the open-source rendering and editing engine for the diagrams professionals actually use — medical, electrical, legal, production, and analytical. 52 diagram families spanning medicine, engineering, law, live production, and analysis:"],"features":["👪 Relationships — genograms, ecomaps, pedigrees, sociograms, phylogenetic trees","⚡ Electrical & Industrial — ladder logic, single-line diagrams, circuit schematics, logic gates, timing, block diagrams, FBD, SFC, breadboard, P&ID (ISA-5.1)","🔄 Behavior & process — UML 2.5 / Harel state diagrams (Mermaid-compatible superset), BPMN 2.0 (OMG), use case diagrams (UML 2.5.1 §18), sequence diagrams (UML 2.5.1 §17 — all 12 combined fragments + ref)","🧩 Software & d